// are the live tooltips. Attack-power and spell-power coefficients are the
// tooltip's, without the "Percent Damage * (1 + Versatility)" the engine
// already applies.
//
// Ids from 910400 are proc buffs whose client id is the parent racial.
// Travel, profession, and cosmetic racials are granted with no combat
// modifier. Player stun breaks, creature-type damage, and Krag'wa's
// attack-power-scaled health and armor have no expression here.
// Monk Arcane Torrent restores 1 Chi (Windwalker). Priest Arcane Torrent
// restores 15 Insanity (Shadow). Expansive Mind is 5 points, 5% of a
